    "translations": {
      "diagram.description.architecture": "Bottom to top. Four bundles, each in its own repository, release into an artifact repository. Domains are thin bundles that select releases, and a person confirms each member: domain1 selects A and B, domain2 selects C and D, and federation, the top domain, selects both. Each release of the top domain rebuilds the context layer, which readers read index first."
